1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:07,754
In nineteen forty five, a Navy flight leader looked down at some islands and decided he was over the Florida Keys.

2
00:00:08,254 --> 00:00:09,724
He was over the Bahamas.

3
00:00:11,124 --> 00:00:14,435
If you think you're over the Keys, home is to the north east.

4
00:00:14,655 --> 00:00:16,658
So he led five planes north east.

5
00:00:16,878 --> 00:00:19,039
Straight out over the open Atlantic.

6
00:00:19,539 --> 00:00:24,443
One student pilot was heard saying that if they just flew west, they would get home.

7
00:00:24,943 --> 00:00:27,385
They ran out of fuel at night over a rough sea.

8
00:00:27,605 --> 00:00:29,435
Fourteen men were never found.

9
00:00:30,835 --> 00:00:35,504
That was Flight 19, the case that started the Bermuda Triangle legend.

10
00:00:35,724 --> 00:00:37,251
No aliens required.

11
00:00:37,751 --> 00:00:40,984
Follow for the real records behind famous mysteries.
